### welcome briefing
POST http://localhost:8763/api/recommendation/welcome-briefing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamId": 1,
  "roomId": 1
}


### welcome briefing cache delete
DELETE http://localhost:8763/api/recommendation/welcome-briefing/cache
Content-Type: application/json

### daily summary - past date
POST http://localhost:8763/api/recommendation/daily-summary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamId": 1,
  "roomId": 1,
  "date": "2026-08-26"
}

### daily summary - custom hours
POST http://localhost:8763/api/recommendation/daily-summary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamId": 1,
  "roomId": 1,
  "date": "2026-08-20",
  "startHour": 10,
  "endHour": 17
}

### daily summary cache delete
DELETE http://localhost:8763/api/recommendation/daily-summary/cache
Content-Type: application/json
